## Bagian C. Verifikasi Sintaks & Semantik Security Rules ([§12 Baris 201–315](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L201-L315))

Hasil pemeriksaan baris demi baris terhadap kode Firestore Security Rules di [§12](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L201-L315):

1. **Kompilasi Statis vs Kegagalan Evaluasi Tipe Data CEL (`Timestamp + int`):**
   - **Yang sudah benar:** Struktur `rules_version = '2'`, deklarasi `match /starts/{startId}`, binding `startId == request.auth.uid + '_' + request.resource.data.quizId + '_1'`, path penuh `/databases/$(database)/documents/...` pada `get()`/`exists()`, `request.resource.data.startedAt == request.time`, `request.resource.data.keys().hasOnly([...])` pada `create`, dan `request.resource.data.diff(resource.data).affectedKeys().hasOnly([...])` pada `update` secara sintaksis valid.
   - **Cacat Fatal #1 — `Timestamp + int` pada `starts` ([baris 228–229](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L228-L229)):**
     ```cel
     && request.time <= get(/databases/$(database)/documents/quizzes/$(request.resource.data.quizId)).data.openAt
          + get(/databases/$(database)/documents/quizzes/$(request.resource.data.quizId)).data.toleransiMulai * 60
     ```
     Di Firestore Rules (CEL), `openAt` bertipe `rules.Timestamp`, sedangkan `toleransiMulai` adalah angka menit (`int`, [§11 baris 175](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L175)). Operator `+` pada `rules.Timestamp` **hanya menerima `rules.Duration`**, **bukan `int`**! Menjumlahkan `Timestamp + int` menghasilkan *runtime evaluation error* (`no such overload`) yang membuat `allow create` pada `starts` **100% ditolak (`PERMISSION_DENIED`)**. Catatan di [baris 316](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L316) (*"`duration * 60` mengonversi menit→detik"*) salah kaprah karena hasil perkalian tetap bertipe `int`, bukan `rules.Duration`. Wajib ditulis:
     `+ duration.value(get(/databases/$(database)/documents/quizzes/$(request.resource.data.quizId)).data.toleransiMulai, 'm')`.
   - **Cacat Fatal #2 — `Timestamp + int + Duration` pada `attempts` ([baris 263–264 dan 270](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L263-L270)):**
     ```cel
     && request.time <= get(/databases/$(database)/documents/starts/$(attemptId)).data.startedAt
          + get(/databases/$(database)/documents/starts/$(attemptId)).data.duration * 60 + duration.value(90,'s');
     ```
     Karena operator `+` dievaluasi dari kiri ke kanan, ekspresi ini mencoba menghitung `(Timestamp + int) + Duration` dan gagal dengan *evaluation error* pada `create` maupun `update`. Wajib ditulis:
     `+ duration.value(get(/databases/$(database)/documents/starts/$(attemptId)).data.duration, 'm') + duration.value(90, 's')`.

2. **Cacat Fatal #3 — Referensi Field Hantu pada `attempts` `allow update` ([baris 269–270](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L269-L270)):**
   ```cel
   && request.time <= resource.data.closeAt
   && request.time <= resource.data.startedAt + resource.data.duration * 60 + duration.value(90,'s');
   ```
   Di dalam `match /attempts/{attemptId}`, objek `resource.data` merujuk pada dokumen `attempts/{attemptId}` yang sedang di-update. Sesuai [baris 260](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L260) (`keys().hasOnly(['answers','updatedAt','submitSeq','uid','quizId','attemptNo','expireAt'])`), dokumen `attempts` **tidak memiliki field `closeAt`, `startedAt`, maupun `duration`** (ketiganya berada di koleksi `starts/{attemptId}`). Mengakses `resource.data.closeAt` pada `attempts` menghasilkan *property undefined error* → **seluruh operasi `update` / retry `attempts` gagal 100%**.

3. **Cacat Fatal #4 — `isAdmin()` Tidak Memiliki Guard `request.auth != null` ([baris 204–206](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L204-L206)) & Tidak Dipasang pada `allow read` di `attempts`, `results`, `quizzes`, `users`, `starts`:**
   - Fungsi `isAdmin()` memanggil `exists(/databases/$(database)/documents/admins/$(request.auth.uid))` tanpa memeriksa `request.auth != null` terlebih dahulu.
   - Ketiadaan `|| isAdmin()` pada `allow read` di `attempts` ([baris 255](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L255)), `results` ([baris 276](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L276)), `quizzes` ([baris 237](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L237)), `users` ([baris 289](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L289)), dan `starts` ([baris 210](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L210)) membuat guru/admin ditolak oleh Firestore saat menilai ujian, melihat pratinjau soal, dan mengekspor CSV.

4. **Cacat Fatal #5 — Tidak Ada Blok `match /progress/{uid}` dan `match /admins/{uid}` di [§12](file:///D:/Project/LMS/PRD%20LMS%20Interaktif%20v0.6.md#L201-L315):**
   - Seluruh baca/tulis ke `progress/{uid}` (modul selesai & XP) serta `admins/{uid}` otomatis ditolak (`PERMISSION_DENIED`).

